# Knot requirement 4: host-supplied node states (available, unavailable, open,
# dirty), dimmed and labelled in words, never by colour alone. A side tile
# cannot hold every label; one it leaves out returns when its node is
# focused, and every node keeps its state in its accessible name.
log requirement 4: node states in words as well as paint
settle 2
assert text Moon phases, unavailable
assert text Tarot notes, unsaved
assert text Index, open
assert text Archive 2025, unavailable
capture r4_centre
resize 280 700
settle 3
key tab-until data-key=archive
settle 1
assert snap focus == data-key=archive
assert text Archive 2025, unavailable
capture r4_side
